13
00:00:40,307 --> 00:00:44,612
Chemical scissors, I like
that-- chemical scissors.

14
00:00:47,781 --> 00:00:48,248
Why?

15
00:00:48,248 --> 00:00:50,718
Well, you can see
because I go back.

16
00:00:50,718 --> 00:00:52,119
What did the oxygen do?

17
00:00:52,119 --> 00:00:56,357
