need that extra electron.

18
00:00:56,357 --> 00:01:00,561
But if I bring now
something like Na2O--

19
00:01:00,561 --> 00:01:02,062
so I've got an O2-.

20
00:01:02,062 --> 00:01:05,032
Now I'm going to add an O2-.

21
00:01:07,768 --> 00:01:11,639
Then what will happen is
you're going to cut this.

22
00:01:11,639 --> 00:01:14,975
So now I'll just draw the--

23
00:01:14,975 --> 00:01:16,377
