can have another one,

29
00:01:35,863 --> 00:01:39,700
and so on and so on.

30
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:42,569
But see, now I've cut.

31
00:01:42,569 --> 00:01:46,974
I've cut the glass pasta,
and I've done it chemically

32
00:01:46,974 --> 00:01:48,709
and I've done it
